{"id":454,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自ら考え主体的に行動する熊大附属中","feature_description":"熊本大学教育学部附属中学校は、大学附属として教育実習や理論的・実証的研究と結びつきながら、公立中学校と同様の中等普通教育を行う学校です。学校教育目標は『自ら考え主体的に行動する生徒を育む』ことで、課活動や部活動、探究的な学びを通して、協働と責任感を育てます。課活動は本校独自の委員会活動として、1〜3年生が役割を分担しながら学校生活を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":8984,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8985,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8986,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8987,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8988,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8989,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8990,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8991,"name":"男子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8992,"name":"女子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8993,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8994,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8995,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kumamoto-fuchu.ed.jp/student-activities","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":899